			"notes": "## Forge 2.0.0 Changelog\n\n### Added\n- Complete project overhaul from the ground up, enhancing code organization and eliminating legacy implementation methods.\n\n### Deprecated\n- **Mod Configuration**: The ability to configure various mod variables has been deprecated in this release. Keep in mind that this feature may stage a comeback in a future update, offering improved functionality.\n\n### Removed\n- **Legacy Forge 1.17.1 Code**: Bid farewell to all remnants of the legacy Forge 1.17.1 project code. This decision aligns with the adoption of child subprojects for both fabric and forge versions of the mod, optimizing the overall structure.\n\n**[GitHub full changelog](https://github.com/Coliwogg/Ores-and-Metals/pull/7/files) --** \"line-of-code\" traceability"
