			"notes": "### NEW ORES AND METALS\n\n**Blocks**:\n- Nether Drakolith Ore\n- Orichalcite Debris\n- Block of Raw Drakolith\n- Block of Orikalkum\n- End Phasmatite Ore\n- Necrite Debris\n- Block of Raw Phasmatite\n- Block of Necronium\n\n**Items**:\n- Raw Drakolith\n- Orichalcite Scrap\n- Orikalkum Ingot\n- Raw Phasmatite\n- Necrite Scrap\n- Necronium Ingot\n\n### NEW TOOLS AND ARMOR\n\n- Orikalkum Tools and Armor\n- Necronium Tools and Armor\n\nRune tools and armor can be smithed with an Orikalkum Ingot to be upgraded to Orikalkum tools and armor.\nOrikalkum tools and armor can be smithed with an Necronium Ingot to be upgraded to Necronium tools and armor.\n\n### Other Changes:\n- Fixed bug where tools were held like regular items.\n- Changed Block of Mithril texture.\n- Changed Tin Ingot texture.\n- Changed Rune Armor textures."
